#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md:6
msgid "Strategies of interop"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md:10
msgid "Sharing data structures and symbols directly is very difficult:"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md:12
msgid ""
"```bob\n"
"╭────────────╮                                          ╭────────────╮\n"
"│            │                                          │            │\n"
"│            │ <--------------------------------------> │            │\n"
"│            │                                          │            │\n"
"╰────────────╯                                          ╰────────────╯\n"
"     Rust                                                    \"C++\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md:21
msgid "FFI through the C ABI is much more feasible:"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/ffi/strategies.md:23
msgid ""
"````````bob\n"
"╭────────────╮          ╭───╮           ╭───╮          ╭────────────╮\n"
"│            │          │   │           │   │          │            │\n"
"│            │ <----->  │   │ <~~~~~~~> │   │ <------> │            │ \n"
"│            │          │   │           │   │          │            │\n"
"╰────────────╯          ╰───╯           ╰───╯          ╰────────────╯\n"
"    Rust                  C               C                 \"C++\"\n"
"````````"
msgstr ""

